sequenceDiagram
    participant Host as Host Process
    participant SandboxA as Sandbox A (Parent Agent)
    participant DelegateProxy as Delegation Proxy<br/>(root, Unix socket)
    participant SandboxB as Sandbox B (Sub-Agent)
    participant SandboxC as Sandbox C (Sub-Agent)

    Note over Host: Max delegation depth: 3<br/>Max concurrent: 6 per parent

    SandboxA->>DelegateProxy: search("web research")
    DelegateProxy->>Host: Forward search request
    Host-->>DelegateProxy: Agent list (name, url, description)
    DelegateProxy-->>SandboxA: Agent results

    SandboxA->>DelegateProxy: run_agent(agent_url)
    DelegateProxy->>Host: Spawn sub-agent request
    Host->>Host: Load sub-agent manifest<br/>Resolve sub-agent API keys<br/>Create new sandbox
    Host->>SandboxB: Create Firecracker VM<br/>with sub-agent's own permissions
    SandboxB-->>Host: {"type": "ready"}
    Host-->>DelegateProxy: session_id
    DelegateProxy-->>SandboxA: session_id

    par Concurrent Sub-Agents
        SandboxA->>DelegateProxy: message(session_id_1, "Research topic A")
        DelegateProxy->>Host: Forward message
        Host->>SandboxB: {"type":"message", ...}
        SandboxB-->>Host: {"type":"response", "done":true}
        Host-->>DelegateProxy: Response
        DelegateProxy-->>SandboxA: Result A
    and
        SandboxA->>DelegateProxy: run_agent(agent_url_2)
        DelegateProxy->>Host: Spawn another sub-agent
        Host->>SandboxC: Create Firecracker VM
        SandboxC-->>Host: {"type": "ready"}
        Host-->>DelegateProxy: session_id_2
        SandboxA->>DelegateProxy: message(session_id_2, "Research topic B")
        DelegateProxy->>Host: Forward message
        Host->>SandboxC: {"type":"message", ...}
        SandboxC-->>Host: {"type":"response", "done":true}
        Host-->>DelegateProxy: Response
        DelegateProxy-->>SandboxA: Result B
    end

    SandboxA->>SandboxA: Combine results

    SandboxA->>DelegateProxy: stop(session_id_1)
    DelegateProxy->>Host: Shutdown sub-agent
    Host->>SandboxB: {"type":"shutdown"}
    Note over SandboxB: VM destroyed

    SandboxA->>DelegateProxy: stop(session_id_2)
    DelegateProxy->>Host: Shutdown sub-agent
    Host->>SandboxC: {"type":"shutdown"}
    Note over SandboxC: VM destroyed

    Note over SandboxA,SandboxC: Each sub-agent has its own<br/>isolated VM, permissions, and API keys
